WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
发光结构从线性骨架逐步形成公共艺术地标。
A luminous framework develops into a public-art landmark.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
蓝、紫、橙色环体在未来站前广场交叠旋转。
Blue, violet and amber rings interlock in a future-station plaza.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.040
双螺旋形地标与概念数据界面共同呈现创新主题。
A double-helix landmark and conceptual data overlays express the innovation theme.
